<details class="session-panel" id="session-create" data-session-create hidden>
    <summary>+ 회차 추가</summary>
    <p class="session-muted">이 행사에 새로운 회차를 추가합니다. 일정·모집 기간·정원·참가비를 입력해 주세요.</p>
    <form method="post" class="session-tools session-create-form" data-session-create-form data-event-id="{{#eventId}}{{eventId}}{{/eventId}}">
        <label class="session-wide">회차명<input name="name" required placeholder="예: 오후 체험 회차"></label>
        <label>개최 시작<input type="datetime-local" step="any" name="startsAt" required></label>
        <label>개최 종료<input type="datetime-local" step="any" name="endsAt" required></label>
        <label>모집 시작<input type="datetime-local" step="any" name="applyStartAt" required></label>
        <label>모집 마감<input type="datetime-local" step="any" name="applyEndAt" required></label>
        <label>정원<input type="number" name="capacity" min="1" max="2147483647" required></label>
        <label>참가비 유형<select name="pricingType"><option value="FREE">무료</option><option value="PAID">유료</option></select></label>
        <label>참가비 (P)<input type="number" name="fee" min="0" value="0" readonly required></label>
        <input type="hidden" name="holdDurationSeconds" value="0">
        <input type="hidden" name="reservationDepositPoints" value="0">
        <input type="hidden" name="minimumParticipants" value="1">
        <input type="hidden" name="minimumCheckAt">
        <div class="session-wide"><button type="submit">회차 추가하기</button></div>
    </form>
</details>
